<http://uaontologies.com/biomass/Biomass#T_aocs_nmg_to_ash>
        rdf:type    <http://uaontologies.com/UAOS_TopLevel/UAOS_TopLevel#SpecificallyDependentContinuant> , <http://uaontologies.com/UAOS_TopLevel/UAOS_TopLevel#Continuant> , <http://uaontologies.com/UAOS_TopLevel/UAOS_TopLevel#Disposition> , <http://uaontologies.com/UAOS_TopLevel/UAOS_TopLevel#SDCCarrier> , <http://uaontologies.com/UAOS_TopLevel/UAOS_TopLevel#IdentifiedEntity> , <http://uaontologies.com/UAOS_Domain/UAOS_States#Transition> , <http://uaontologies.com/UAOS_TopLevel/UAOS_TopLevel#Function> , owl:Thing , <http://uaontologies.com/UAOS_TopLevel/UAOS_TopLevel#RealizableEntity> ;
        <http://uaontologies.com/UAOS_Domain/UAOS_Modes#isSubTransitionOf>
                <http://uaontologies.com/biomass/Biomass#T_sc_pom_to_saf> ;
        <http://uaontologies.com/UAOS_Domain/UAOS_States#enters>
                <http://uaontologies.com/biomass/Biomass#aocs_ash> ;
        <http://uaontologies.com/UAOS_TopLevel/UAOS_TopLevel#hasName>
                "AOCS NM-GAP-to-ASH Transition" ;
        <http://uaontologies.com/UAOS_TopLevel/UAOS_TopLevel#hasNaturalLanguageDescription>
                "Intended recovery transition from Normal Mode (GAP) back to ASH. In the MOCD, this path existed only as an alarm-triggered (FDIR) transition, not as a TC-commandable route. The SEAM deployment simulation failed when this transition was requested (thesis §8.6, p.147): no TC-commandable NM-to-ASH path was defined. The absence of exitedBy models this: the transition is not available in aocs_nmg, and the TransitionAvailability rule does not fire. Query Q03 detects the missing source mode." ;
        <http://uaontologies.com/UAOS_TopLevel/UAOS_TopLevel#sdo>
                <http://uaontologies.com/biomass/Biomass#aocs> ;
        owl:sameAs  <http://uaontologies.com/biomass/Biomass#T_aocs_nmg_to_ash> .

